      "summaries": {
        "en": "Flowise is a visual low-code platform that simplifies building AI agents and workflows, addressing the complexity of integrating multiple AI components. It uses a drag-and-drop interface to connect LangChain modules, LLMs, and tools, enabling rapid prototyping without deep coding expertise. Developers can create chatbots, automate tasks, or experiment with multi-agent systems by visually designing flows, making it ideal for prototyping AI applications or exploring agentic AI concepts in practice.",
        "zh": "Flowise 是一个可视化低代码平台，旨在简化 AI 智能体和复杂工作流的构建过程，解决了整合多种 AI 组件时的技术门槛问题。它通过拖拽式界面连接 LangChain 模块、大语言模型和各种工具，让用户无需深入编码即可快速搭建原型。开发者可以用它设计聊天机器人、自动化任务流程或探索多智能体系统，特别适合快速验证 AI 应用想法或在实践中学习智能体架构的设计思路。",
        "es": "Flowise is a visual low-code platform that simplifies building AI agents and workflows, addressing the complexity of integrating multiple AI components. It uses a drag-and-drop interface to connect LangChain modules, LLMs, and tools, enabling rapid prototyping without deep coding expertise. Developers can create chatbots, automate tasks, or experiment with multi-agent systems by visually designing flows, making it ideal for prototyping AI applications or exploring agentic AI concepts in practice.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Flowise stands out for agentic-ai, agentic-workflow, and agents in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Flowise is a visual low-code platform that simplifies building AI agents and workflows, addressing the complexity of integrating multiple AI components. It uses a drag-and-drop interface to connect LangChain modules, LLMs, and tools, enabling rapid prototyping without deep coding expertise. Developers can create chatbots, automate tasks, or experiment with multi-agent systems by visually designing flows, making it ideal for prototyping AI applications or exploring agentic AI concepts in practice.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
