        "zh": "MoneyPrinterV2是一个开源自动化工具，旨在帮助内容创作者简化在线盈利流程，通过减少重复性手动操作提高效率。该项目采用Python构建的命令行界面，能够编排内容创建工作流，实现跨平台可盈利内容的批量处理。其模块化架构允许开发者扩展功能，例如集成更多API接口或定制特定领域的模板，适合用于实验自动化内容策略的实际场景。",
        "es": "MoneyPrinterV2 is an open-source automation tool that helps creators streamline online content monetization by reducing repetitive manual tasks. It works through a Python-based CLI that orchestrates content creation workflows, enabling batch processing of monetizable content across platforms. Developers can extend its modular architecture to integrate with additional APIs or customize templates for specific niches, making it practical for testing automated content strategies.",
